00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:37.510
May, 1590 - Odawara - Enouramura - Ōnogorobe Residence

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:50.730
This is Master Rikyū's Tenshōan?

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:57.960
I don't know what to say. This is beyond the understanding of a normal human being!

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:04.240
This isn't a mountain residence in a city, but a city residence in a mountain?

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:11.570
This is better for one who is tired of rustic countryside charm.

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:15.420
I must commend his creativity.

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:19.530
But this man defies common sense through and through.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:25.840
I must acertain his true intentions.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.140
Forgive My Silence

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:46.700
How does your body feel?

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:51.550
You must work for me until Hōjō falls.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.600
Are you hating me for what happened to Sōji?

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:05.280
I hope you didn't poison this.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:16.990
Delicious.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:28.110
Are you telling me your true intentions through this?

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:33.210
Let me ask you then. What does that vase mean?

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:39.510
Why is the crack on the bamboo pointed towards me?

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:53.110
All right. Come to the main hall.
I'll perform a tea ceremony for you.

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.620
Thank you all for coming today.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:35.240
I shall perform a tea ceremony today for all of those at the front lines.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:44.330
Let me dance for victory before then.

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.880
Dance, Rikyū.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.000
You better dance.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.720
I cannot bear to watch Master like this anymore.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:05.320
Hold it in. Master is hurting quite a bit on the inside, too.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:08.580
As his disciples, we must stick with him to the end.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.530
Lord Oribe, a letter came from Master Rikyū.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:26.150
He's happy about my present!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.380
Sending him the bamboo first was the correct thiing to do.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:33.960
If I had sent him those military-style stirrups, that would have been awkward.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:38.210
I don't think the other commanders have ever received a letter like this.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:43.230
I must respond appropriately this time.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:46.680
And send him the famed treasure, Musashi Stirrups!

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:50.230
Beginning of June, 1590 - Sagami Province - Ashigara

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:59.340
That over there is Mt. Kintoki.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:03.780
The place where Sakata Kintoki defeated the most powerful demon of all, Shuten Dōji?

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:05.310
That's right.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.910
When the Ten Works of Oribe are complete,

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:16.180
my huge libido will erupt just like that mountain.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:37.620
That was close!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.190
Are you all right?

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:45.650
It's an ambush. Two of our horses got shot.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:50.580
What's the symbol on that flag?

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.260
I have no idea.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.610
They're here! Attack!

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:03.710
Report your name! We may not have to fight!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:09.620
It's your own fault for storming into our land!

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:14.410
I'll take your leader's head and give it to the Chief Advisor!

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:22.780
Then I'll have my excuse for being late!

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.740
So you're the leader?

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.740
You ambush us without even giving us your name. Have you no shame!?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.970
I'll destroy you like how Kintoki defeated that demon!

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:52.500
Let me tell you now that I'll be the one to send you packing.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:54.480
My name is!

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:02.890
The supreme ruler of Ōu! The legendary one-eyed dragon!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:03.900
Now's my chance!

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.720
Don't underestimate me.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:20.180
This is chest armor made by the Yukinoshita Masa family in Aizu, the famous Five-Layered Bronze Plate!

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:41.560
Lord Takayama...

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:46.540
Put away your sword, Lord Date Masamune.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:51.100
Do you know who that man is?

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:56.320
He is beloved by the Chief Advisor, and the high disciple of Master Rikyū.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:59.690
Lord Furuta Oribe.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:24.780
I apologize for my rudeness! I never thought that you're that famous Oribe from the tea ceremony...

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:31.210
This man knows who I am? My fame has spread to the far north already!

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:33.900
Well, I was at fault, too.

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:37.110
I heard you were heading for Odawara...

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:41.350
I should have treated you a lot nicer if I had known you were Lord Date...

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:47.250
I was ordered to help guide you.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.560
Lord Maeda Toshiie is waiting for you in Hakone.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:57.230
I heard you had moved to Kaga after the incident at Kyushu.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:01.280
Please forgive me for not even sending you a letter.

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:05.930
I'm just a commander working under Lord Maeda now.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:10.970
Someone of my rank is not worth worrying about, Lord Oribe.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.730
There you go again.

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:15.630
Just call me Brother.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:22.350
We sincerely apologize, Lord Oribe.

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:25.730
We will pay you back for the two horses!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.180
Killing without purpose is not wise.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:33.190
We must hold a proper service, even for horses.

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:42.440
It stinks!

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:43.950
I'm about to throw up...

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:47.260
Why does Maeda's barracks smell so badly?

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:49.240
I don't know who's responsible for this,

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.750
but I'll make him pay!

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:06.690
It's delicious!

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:09.700
This is unexpectedly good, Katakura.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:13.630
I've had wild boar before, but a horse...

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:16.690
Don't just focus on eating.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:21.400
The Chief Advisor is still quite mad at your tardiness.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:26.590
Well, I'm in the same position as you, actually.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:32.050
I heard you were holed up for some time at Sokokura?

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.900
Before we meet with the Chief Advisor,

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:40.070
Lord Maeda will be asking you about your whereabouts.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:44.810
Is he mad at my unrestrained swagger at Ōu?

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:50.230
Oh well. I'll just take a listen at what he has to say.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:53.500
You may want to change that weird way of talking.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:56.580
You're just asking for your own death in front of the Chief Advisor.

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:04.350
And also... Your men are like bandits chasing after a wild boar in the mountains.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:08.740
They aren't feeling any remorse at all.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:10.600
That's going too far!

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:16.550
This is Master Rikyū's head disciple speaking, Katakura.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:19.930
Just shut up and listen.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:22.600
I think the eyepatch though is pretty cool.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:26.640
In the lettering of foreigners, 伊達 is DATE.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:28.920
竜 is DRAGON.

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.000
Both start with D.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:36.300
You are considerate to the foreigners. That is great.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:41.940
You didn't know that?

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:46.250
In any case, Date will be paying his tributes.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:55.370
I, Imai Sōkun, will prepare a tea ceremony with him along with providing the proper clothing.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:14:01.310
No, I do not think the Chief Advisor will be satisfied with just that.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:09.140
You will have to prepare white garbs.

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:13.640
I don't think they'll have wear clothes to commit seppuku!

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:16.500
In the past, I...

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:36.530
If you aren't prepared to die, then forget about conveying your sincerity.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:44.410
If you truly follow Toyotomi, then this shouldn't be too difficult for you, Lord Date.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:00.280
All right, Lord Oribe.

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:05.090
But if things turn for the worse,

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:10.920
then don't think this one-eyed dragon is going to let you off easy.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:17.560
You're helping out on the attack of Oshi Castle next?

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:21.900
Goodness, you sure can't catch a break.

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:29.310
Please make sure you deliver the letter and the item to Master.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:32.610
I can't believe you said all that to Lord Date, though.

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.700
He's quite serious, you know.

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:38.790
I'm just telling him my thoughts as a warrior.

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:45.570
If he really wears white garb to see the Chief Advisor...

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.040
What'll happen?

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:52.030
He'll be an idiot like I was!

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:58.490
This is no laughing matter.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:02.270
Lord Date may come after you for revenge, you know.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.210
Revenge? That's fine with me.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.820
I'll show off my deathblow, the Ass Slash.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:12.320
June 8th, 1590 - Hakone - Sokokura

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:18.480
Today's the end of your stay.

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:23.530
You will see the Chief Advisor at Mt. Ishigaki tomorrow.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:30.720
I hope your time with me has made you more aware of things.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:32.350
I've always been aware of things.

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:34.570
What is the Chief Advisor thinking?

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:38.270
He won't kill me then, will he?

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.360
Impossible, impossible.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:43.790
As long as you don't anger him, he won't kill you.

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:49.070
But I heard that he's quite generous with those who bow their heads down for him?

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.280
Quite generous.

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:54.980
As generous as the size of the southern seas.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:00.300
I also heard he is ruthless towards Hōjō's men.

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:03.040
That he'll kill them all?

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.780
Yep, he'll kill them all.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:09.930
That's why you shouldn't let your guard down, even for an instant.

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:11.340
Make yourself clear, damnit!

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.790
Parden my tardiness.

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:23.180
Ōu's sixty-six cities are all yours now.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:31.090
This is a riot! Those clothes aren't fit for seppuku at all!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:32.150
Lord Hosokawa.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.500
You're a good man.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.160
Masamune.

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:46.030
We meet on good terms here at Odawara.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.280
If you came a little later...

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:51.320
This place...

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:53.150
Right here...

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:55.900
Will be lopped right off.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.470
You're a funny guy.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:26.940
I wanted to just sweep down and take everything.

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:30.310
I'll just take Aizu this time.

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:34.960
You can continue protecting Ōu.

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:39.790
Of course, I'll continue my conquest northeast.

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.590
Please do your best.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.820
Thank you very much, Chief Advisor.

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:49.950
You dumbass!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.520
Enjoy the taste a bit more before gulping it down.

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:56.140
Do you not understand the way of the tea?

00:19:57.620 --> 00:20:00.750
I do want to learn more about the ways of imperfection.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:03.900
I want to meet Master Rikyū soon.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:10.440
So you don't place any importance in my tea service?

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:23.270
That's not true, Chief Advisor.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:26.370
Good.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:35.480
When Ishigakiyama Castle is finished, the Hōjō clan will tremble in fear and surrender.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.870
But it's too late already.

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:42.210
I will not forgive those who don't gel well with me.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:44.660
You better remember that.

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:50.880
If they find out the walls are made of paper, then it'll be a different story.

00:20:57.700 --> 00:20:59.590
You've got a sharp eye.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:03.640
I haven't even taken you for a closer look.
You knew the walls are made of paper already?

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.980
If you like imperfection that much,

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:09.790
then go pay a visit to Rikyū before going home.

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:18.470
Is this all right, Chief Advisor?

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:21.400
Forgiving such a barbarian?

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:22.910
It's fine, it's fine.

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:25.580
We'll just sit back and see what happens for now.

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:29.810
Cutting his head off is just a matter of time.

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:38.590
I know his loyalty lies elsewhere, but that little boonie show he put up was pretty cute.

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:44.080
It was just like me in the past.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:53.040
Master is still recovering.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:56.110
I'm afraid he's not able to serve all of you as promised.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:57.710
But...

00:21:57.940 --> 00:22:00.770
Don't push the matter, Katakura.

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:06.450
Can you tell him this for me then?

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:13.150
No matter what happens, I, Date Masamune,

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:16.470
want to become Master Rikyū's disciple.

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:22.380
Thank goodness nothing bad happened.

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:27.550
Monk Kosai did warn me not to get laughed at.

00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:31.570
But it seems like that's exactly what happened.

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:34.110
That's what I want them to think.

00:22:34.430 --> 00:22:37.560
They'll be crying the next time we meet.

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:41.980
However, Katakura.

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:45.880
We owe someone this time.

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:52.090
That man named Oribe.

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:06.410
Everytime I　

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:06.410
Anata no mune

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:08.800
feel your heart

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:08.800
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:14.890
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:14.890
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:21.070
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:21.070
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:27.230
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:27.230
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:33.320
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:33.320
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:37.200
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:37.200
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:40.780
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:40.780
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:46.650
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:46.650
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:49.650
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:49.650
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.730 --> 00:23:52.260
Without each other.

00:23:49.730 --> 00:23:52.260
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:53.220
You should

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:53.220
Soshite

00:23:53.310 --> 00:23:58.720
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.310 --> 00:23:58.720
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:02.510
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:02.510
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:08.220
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:08.220
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:14.710
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:14.710
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.770 --> 00:24:20.510
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.770 --> 00:24:20.510
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.990 --> 00:24:26.490
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.990 --> 00:24:26.490
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:35.110 --> 00:24:36.720
You're a good guy!

00:24:41.750 --> 00:24:43.270
Refined, yet imperfect.

00:24:48.510 --> 00:24:49.950
What does "no fun" mean?

00:24:50.740 --> 00:24:52.780
Aesthete's Crossroad.

00:24:53.550 --> 00:24:54.910
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.650 --> 00:24:58.210
That is the question.

00:24:56.460 --> 00:24:59.750
Aesthete's Crossroad
